# LeakSanitizer suppressions for tools/asan.py. Only allocations PHP itself makes and
# frees in its own shutdown, after the extension's MSHUTDOWN check: never a frame of
# this repository or of upstream Swoole.
#
# Internal functions' arg_info, which zend_register_functions mallocs and keeps only
# a pointer one past the return slot of, so no pointer points into the block.
leak:zend_register_functions
